abraflexi-clientzone (2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed package from clientzone to abraflexi-clientzone
  * Migrated from FlexiPeeHP to AbraFlexi (spojenet/flexibee) namespace
  * Upgraded UI from Bootstrap 3 to Bootstrap 5 (TWB5)
  * Replaced GlyphIcons with Font Awesome icons
  * Replaced \Ease\TWB\Well with \Ease\TWB5\Card
  * Updated all API methods: insertToAbraFlexi, loadFromAbraFlexi, getAbraFlexiURL
  * SetupForm updated for new AbraFlexi\ui\TWB5\ConnectionForm API
  * Replaced TWBSwitch with Ease\Html\Widgets\Toggle
  * Modernized WebPage with Bootstrap 5 dark navbar and card-based layout
  * Added AppStream metainfo for software center integration
  * Requires PHP 8.4+
  * Updated Debian packaging to debhelper 13 with InstalledVersions support

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 30 Jun 2024 12:00:00 +0200

